  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7b4fabdb-3f2f-478b-811f-7c097505d1b0.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_778a4853-a8b1-4ef4-b572-887bcf6e7a0f.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1342172/description_9df28931-cd06-4cba-9cd5-f55a9f29a703.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_828824d8-3876-4b8b-8607-85dad8698290.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_778a4853-a8b1-4ef4-b572-887bcf6e7a0f.png\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>這個模組新增了什麼？</strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">鎚子可以像鎬子一樣用於挖礦，但只需一擊就能破壞3x3範圍內的方塊，為您帶來驚人的速度和效率。現在，挖礦或進行大型建築工程變得更加輕鬆快速！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_778a4853-a8b1-4ef4-b572-887bcf6e7a0f.png\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如何合成？</strong></h1><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ec99cd6b-9393-4d98-8e78-f34f77cee43c.png\"></strong></p><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_421c64b9-d1fd-4965-ab13-1910a220160c.png\"></strong></p><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a6744d1c-fe19-44b3-b937-1389f89b89bc.png\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_778a4853-a8b1-4ef4-b572-887bcf6e7a0f.png\"></strong></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>支援版本</strong></h1><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.21.8 Neoforge &amp; Fabric</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.21.4 Neoforge</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.21.1 Neoforge</strong></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_778a4853-a8b1-4ef4-b572-887bcf6e7a0f.png\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>我的其他模組</strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ardas-sculks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1194241/description_092611aa-1d76-40ab-9c74-34984fe74b67.png\"></a> </strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_778a4853-a8b1-4ef4-b572-887bcf6e7a0f.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">您可以在整合包中使用我的模組。</p>",
